  "description": "The engine's own HTTP-request-processing glue a host otherwise hand-copies per route — currently just file-upload handling (validating a posted file against a field's own declared MaxSizeBytes/AcceptedFileTypes, saving it via IServiceRequestFileStorage, and writing the resulting reference into fieldValues). Plain functions, no routing of its own — a host calls these from inside its own minimal-API handlers, the same way Wayfinder.Rendering.GovUk's GovUkStageJourney functions are called.",
